        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Share Your Interests",
        "content": "<p>We welcome inquiries about professional trainings, guest speakers, and future educational offerings. If you are interested in learning more, attending a training, or sharing what topics you would like to see, please complete the form below.</p><p><strong>Contact Us at (302) 608-3780. </strong></p><p><em>We typically respond within 24 hours.</em></p><p>You may also complete our contact form, and a member of our team will be in touch.</p><p><em><strong>This form is not intended for emergencies or urgent mental health concerns. If you are experiencing an emergency, call 911 or go to your nearest emergency room.</strong></em></p>",
